ilson, and the 2005 row shows Newman/Haas Racing as the Team with driver Sébastien Bourdais. Since the question asks which team won the year before RuSPORT (2006), that's the 2005 season, and the corrected team is Newman/Haas Racing.", "detection_point": "upfront", "anomaly_evidence": "Rows for 2005 and 2006 have Season blank and all values shifted right by one column (e.g., '2005' appears under Date, 'July 17' under Driver, 'Sébastien Bourdais' under Team)", "answer": "Newman/Haas Racing", "dtype": "string"}
