191), Baraboo from 10711 to 12048 (+1337), Appleton from 70087 to 72623 (+2536), and so on. Sorting the top 3 by growth in ascending order gives Beloit, Baraboo, Appleton.", "detection_point": "upfront", "anomaly_evidence": "The Population (2010 Census) column header shows '2310' in the data row instead of a year, and values like 72623 for Antigo and 36966 for Beaver Dam are clearly misaligned — they belong to different rows.", "answer": "['Beloit', 'Baraboo', 'Appleton']", "dtype": "list"}
