t values are all displaced by one position. Correcting this shift, Fairmount's land area is 102 km² and Tonganoxie's land area is 137 km². Comparing all townships' land areas, Tonganoxie has the largest at 137 km².", "detection_point": "upfront", "anomaly_evidence": "Rows for Fairmount and Tonganoxie have Township blank and values shifted right (e.g., 'Fairmount' in FIPS column, '22325' in Population center column, 'Basehor' in Population column)", "answer": "Tonganoxie", "dtype": "string"}
