nly B'in Music album in an even-numbered year is the 8th, \"Kissing The Future of Love.\"", "detection_point": "upfront", "anomaly_evidence": "Pervasive OCR substitutions across many cells: 'Znd' for '2nd', 'l999' for '1999', '5tar' for 'Star', '5eptember' for 'September', 'Bth/8th' for '8th', 'ZOO3' for '2003', '0ctober' for 'October', 'B'in Music' for 'B'in Music', etc.", "answer": "Kissing The Future of Love", "dtype": "string"}
