hese OCR artifacts (Z→2, B→8, l→1, O→0, S→5), the most recent creation dates are Santa Anita (26 October 1989), Los Olivos (7 April 1989), Villa El Salvador (1 June 1983), and San Borja (1 June 1983), making Santa Anita the last district created.", "detection_point": "mid_computation", "anomaly_evidence": "Created column dates contain OCR-distorted characters, e.g. 'Z6 October 1989' for Santa Anita (Z→2), 'l June l9B3' (B→8), '1B57' (B→8), 'l6 January l962' (l→1), etc.", "answer": "Santa Anita", "dtype": "string"}
