 entry is 'Malaya' (1949), so the first and last movies are 'The Maltese Falcon' and 'Malaya'.", "detection_point": "upfront", "anomaly_evidence": "First row has '1941 1941' in Year, two titles 'The Maltese Falcon They Died with Their Boots On', and two roles merged into one row", "answer": ["The Maltese Falcon", "Malaya"], "dtype": "list"}
