h correspond to the first row (1941, The Maltese Falcon) and the last row (1949, Malaya), neither of which is affected by the noise, so the answer is The Maltese Falcon and Malaya.", "detection_point": "upfront", "anomaly_evidence": "Year values '19~41', '194#4', '1~944', '1`944' contain injected special characters", "answer": ["The Maltese Falcon", "Malaya"], "dtype": "list"}
